{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arise Wyver and fly against overwhelming odds in this modern labor of love tribute to classic shoot'em ups!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC 4K/120FPS CINEMATIC ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575710/extras/DU4WU_GIF_1S.gif?t=1754384644\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like Ikaruga, Touhou and CAVE shmups, Danmaku Unlimited 4 WYVER ULTRA is a labor of love that perfectly blends stylish cinematic action with nail-biting bullet hell gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRIKE BACK WITH THE BLADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575710/extras/DU4WU_GIF_4S.gif?t=1754384644\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the table on your enemies with powerful screen clearing energy blade attacks. Master the blade and see your score reach stratospheric heights!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE INTENSE BOSS FIGHTS TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575710/extras/DU4WU_GIF_6S.gif?t=1754384644\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly between life and death through mesmerizing bullet patterns solo or together in local two player co-op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Bullet Hell Shoot'em up in glorious 4K and 120FPS on a custom homebrew engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the storm of enemy bullets into powerful attacks with the WYVER Blade System\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly solo or local coop with a variety of fighters to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes and difficulties for newcomers and genre veterans alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic soundtracks by BLANKFIELD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay system to revisit or share your perfect run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboards and Achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575710?t=1754384644","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575710/6fdd6fcd60d768329b60f85875c5823f75722e54/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754384644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575710/36e432ffe3c52a8d1e24b659ffe81ebd1d08e96b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754384644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575710/36e432ffe3c52a8d1e24b659ffe81ebd1d08e96b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754384644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arise Wyver and fly against overwhelming odds in this modern labor of love tribute to classic shoot'em ups!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC 4K/120FPS CINEMATIC ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575710/extras/DU4WU_GIF_1S.gif?t=1